    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cats &amp; Cakes: The Card Game is a cozy card-stacking bakery sim where you bake pastries, serve eccentric feline customers, and manage the chaos of your shop in real time. Build fame, decorate your bakery shop!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/9a3c61ec83de831e9ac6fdc0b5f002d9.webp?t=1753475015\" width=16 height=15 /></span>\u00a0Mix &amp; Bake!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every paw-some pastry starts with the purrfect combination of ingredient cards \u2014 think Flour, Butter, Chocolate \u2014 whisked together with tool cards like Mixer, Ovens, and Piping Bags.<br>Need a hint? The recipe book\u2019s always there for a sneaky peek! As you bake your way forward, you\u2019ll unlock delightful new recipes, including legendary secret treats.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/12c7d8a521958cd2081811636127a6bc.poster.avif?t=1753475015\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/12c7d8a521958cd2081811636127a6bc.webm?t=1753475015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/12c7d8a521958cd2081811636127a6bc.mp4?t=1753475015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/c43e596e0df6ee4dc70e97c2e007050e.poster.avif?t=1753475015\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/c43e596e0df6ee4dc70e97c2e007050e.webm?t=1753475015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/c43e596e0df6ee4dc70e97c2e007050e.mp4?t=1753475015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/9a3c61ec83de831e9ac6fdc0b5f002d9.webp?t=1753475015\" width=16 height=15 /></span>\u00a0Serve Hungry Cats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag a \u2018Customer\u2019 card onto a \u2018Table\u2019 card to reveal their pastry cravings.<br>Be quick! Feline customers don\u2019t like to wait, and only the fastest paws will deliver their dream desserts before they leave in a huff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/b9a70713bc95b1878604a1a9ced246f3.poster.avif?t=1753475015\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/b9a70713bc95b1878604a1a9ced246f3.webm?t=1753475015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/b9a70713bc95b1878604a1a9ced246f3.mp4?t=1753475015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/9a3c61ec83de831e9ac6fdc0b5f002d9.webp?t=1753475015\" width=16 height=15 /></span> Complete Quests &amp; Earn Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle cozy quests, unlock shiny new recipes, upgrade your bakery tools, or discover an artifact that give your baking station permanent buffs. The more you bake, the more you rise through the whiskered ranks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi