3475015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/c43e596e0df6ee4dc70e97c2e007050e.mp4?t=1753475015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/9a3c61ec83de831e9ac6fdc0b5f002d9.webp?t=1753475015\" width=16 height=15 /></span>\u00a0Serve Hungry Cats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag a \u2018Customer\u2019 card onto a \u2018Table\u2019 card to reveal their pastry cravings.<br>Be quick! Feline customers don\u2019t like to wait, and only the fastest paws will deliver their dream desserts before they leave in a huff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/b9a70713bc95b1878604a1a9ced246f3.poster.avif?t=1753475015\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/b9a70713bc95b1878604a1a9ced246f3.webm?t=1753475015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/b9a70713bc95b1878604a1a9ced246f3.mp4?t=1753475015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718610/extras/9a3c61ec83de831e9ac6fdc0b5f002d9.webp?t=1753475015\" width=16 height=15 /></span> Complete Quests &amp; Earn Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle cozy quests, unlock shiny new recipes, upgrade your bakery tools, or discover an artifact that give your baking station permanent buffs. The more you bake, the more you rise through the whiskered ranks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl